      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"the employer\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4c45759db656ebf9707e75f768e810fc2d8e746043ffa17f27976c3b9c0d6a15\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:18eabda7cd4200dee05b1542b9660761a187c68012fdb7843de1909f391f4e93\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:8a90cfa298ba2f29fde5354e80746f7db4efe81c1febb0e0879877799f044f1c\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1ec436a320ecda7280617406c5b5bdaef7af13713aa0f165c5413365ef9ad7d9\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5be53cc358ee881df5308ff9bb37b6d7d044922dc7982add41d3bdf5fb3a6d8f\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"defined_terms\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1392,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1392,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A34ab00d74d098e7a97f5e36e70fbb24ca8a0b1a16f5e62c6c64a1050011d93b3:1233:1392:sha256-3abde15c1450f4eb348a93af4c10310e186af6928d9ffeff88c76fd2dffbb9a1\",\"quote\":\"(i) Select, and have each affected employee use, the types of PPE that will protect the affected employee from the hazards identified in the hazard assessment;\",\"start\":1233},{\"end\":1231,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A34ab00d74d098e7a97f5e36e70fbb24ca8a0b1a16f5e62c6c64a1050011d93b3:935:1231:sha256-fd2b5c1045c9e2707385b0b5e62d7ca6c1522e59e97a09eb84ca6a69ad56f395\",\"quote\":\"(d) Hazard assessment and equipment selection. (1) The employer shall assess the workplace to determine if hazards are present, or are likely to be present, which necessitate the use of personal protective equipment (PPE). If such hazards are present, or likely to be present, the employer shall:\",\"start\":935}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:c4f30c8583f8273df9b96c661b53ef4324e27e21a7a8b0010fb05f99b675ea0f\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5be53cc358ee881df5308ff9bb37b6d7d044922dc7982add41d3bdf5fb3a6d8f\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:11f3528b72b2990dedde2bc319565dcaa112f50fde9abf4b40b2670d8267c875\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(i) Select, and have each affected employee use, the types of PPE that will protect the affected employee from the hazards identified in the hazard assessment;\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:43d53cec3d660830bafb539a0dc411eae56abfec371cbd176b463ad0fa03af96\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(d) Hazard assessment and equipment selection. (1) The employer shall assess the workplace to determine if hazards are present, or are likely to be present, which necessitate the use of personal protective equipment (PPE). If such hazards are present, or likely to be present, the employer shall:\"],\"scope_text\":\"If such hazards are present, or likely to be present\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:87c1a2c85baf7201b9a8fbaa89b09346664233b009ba47bdf620475e2e24013c\",\"start\":1233,\"summary\":\"If hazards necessitating the use of personal protective equipment (PPE) are present, or likely to be present, in the workplace, the employer shall select, and have each affected employee use, the types of PPE that will protect the affected employee from the hazards identified in the hazard assessment.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
