      "@type": "rkaf:SourceFragment",
      "oa:hasSource": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:34ab00d74d098e7a97f5e36e70fbb24ca8a0b1a16f5e62c6c64a1050011d93b3",
      "rkaf:fragmentIdentityScheme": "rkaf:carrier-local-fragment",
      "rkaf:sourceArtifactDigest": "sha256:34ab00d74d098e7a97f5e36e70fbb24ca8a0b1a16f5e62c6c64a1050011d93b3",
      "rkaf:fragmentContentDigest": "sha256:70ab0e664f8dbb05fc6b0439f445eadb6cdc3a94f0cdb4799e6cf95984596a60",
      "rkaf:selectorKind": [
        "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
        "oa:TextPositionSelector"
      ],
      "oa:hasSelector": [
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(f) Training. (1) The employer shall provide training to each employee who is required by this section to use PPE. Each such employee shall be trained to know at least the following:\n\n(i) When PPE is necessary;\n\n(ii) What PPE is necessary;\n\n(iii) How to properly don, doff, adjust, and wear PPE;\n\n(iv) The limitations of the PPE; and,\n\n(v) The proper care, maintenance, useful life and disposal of the PPE."
        },
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextPositionSelector",
          "oa:start": 2110,
          "oa:end": 2516,
          "rkaf:coordinateSystem": "rkaf:unicode-codepoint"
        }
      ]
    },
